.TH HTTP_REQUEST_DUMP 3
.SH NAME
http_request_dump \- print a request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <http.h>
.P
.BI "void http_request_dump(http_request* " req ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR http_request_dump ()
writes the serial, type, location and headers of the request to standard error. It does nothing unless the library
was built with DEBUG_HTTP.
.SH SEE ALSO
http_dump(3)
